# Web3Forms access key (https://web3forms.com — free, no account required).
# Submissions from the reservation and newsletter forms are emailed to the
# address you verify when generating the key.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, and add the same
# variable in the Vercel dashboard for production.
#
# If this is unset, both forms fall back to a local-only success state so the
# demo still works without an account.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
